# Netscape HTTP Cookie File
# This is an example cookies file for V4 Clipper.
#
# If YouTube requests "Sign in to confirm you're not a bot" or restricts access:
# 1. Log into your Google / YouTube account in your desktop or mobile browser.
# 2. Export cookies using a browser extension (such as "Get cookies.txt LOCALLY" or "Cookie-Editor").
# 3. Export in Netscape format and save as:
#    ~/v4-clipper/data/cookies.txt
#
# Ensure permissions are restricted (e.g., chmod 600 data/cookies.txt).
# V4 Clipper will automatically load this file to authenticate yt-dlp requests.
#
# Example format:
# .youtube.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	1735689600	LOGIN_INFO	AFmmF2swRQIh...
# .youtube.com	TRUE	/	TRUE	1735689600	SAPISID	abcdef123456...
